## 📦 24. Parameterization

```ts
test.each([
  ['user1', 'pass1'],
  ['user2', 'pass2'],
])('Login with %s', async ({ page }, username, password) => {
  await page.fill('#user', username);
  await page.fill('#pass', password);
  await page.click('#login');
});
```

